pkgconf is a pkg-config compatible tool: it reports the compile and link flags that
libraries ask for in their .pc files. Meson and most build systems need it to find
libraries. Installs pkgconf, a pkg-config symlink, libpkgconf and its headers under
/usr/local; searches /usr/local/lib/pkgconfig first.
upstream: https://github.com/pkgconf/pkgconf
